	(text "SUPERCAP TELEMETRY: GPIO3 / ADC1_CH3, 0 dB. Vcap = 21 x calibrated ADC volts.\nR24/R25 = 2M/100k; C13 = 100nF. Wait 100ms; average before Wi-Fi.\nLow ratio keeps input below 0.263V at 5.4V storage, including when ESP is off.\nDivider draws 2.38uA at 5V. Calibrate against a meter for better accuracy."
		(at 317.5 414.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "251e2f75-b533-4e1e-89ce-2d1454af5ba8")
	)
